info  R35 the bar         = per interrupt leg 1200 of 1200: a file of the leg's positive set (its engine's own notifier or the host's default one) readable within 2000 ms, the semaphore holding the payload, every copied word verified; every file OUTSIDE the set silent; the no-interrupt control silent; the quiet window silent. ⊘ A wake is a WAKE: the semaphore is read after it
